1
00:00:00,086 --> 00:00:01,506
(Penny:)Oh, balls.

2
00:00:01,671 --> 00:00:04,551
(Sheldon:)It's a warm summer evening
in ancient Greece.

3
00:00:06,384 --> 00:00:08,554
(Howard:)Okay, I got a bone to pick with you.

4
00:00:08,845 --> 00:00:10,015
(Leonard:)What did I do now?

5
00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:13,680
(Howard:)I was in bed with Bernadette
and you text-blocked me.

6
00:00:14,726 --> 00:00:17,066
(Bernadette:)-What?
-Yeah, we were completely naked...

7
00:00:17,228 --> 00:00:18,858
...and about to devour each other
when:

8
00:00:19,022 --> 00:00:20,232
[IMITATES CELL PHONE CHIMING]

9
00:00:20,398 --> 00:00:23,108
(Howard:)You text her that I have a problem
with her hanging with you.

10
00:00:23,276 --> 00:00:26,406
(Leonard:)You do have a problem with her
hanging out with me.

11
00:00:26,571 --> 00:00:28,361
(Howard:)But that's not what you tell her.

12
00:00:28,531 --> 00:00:30,491
-What was I to tell her?
-I don't know.

13
00:00:30,658 --> 00:00:34,538
(Howard:)Something that doesn't make me
come off as a petty, jealous douche.

14
00:00:35,538 --> 00:00:37,788
(Leonard:)And what would that be?

15
00:00:39,793 --> 00:00:42,583
(Penny:)Come on,
do I have to think of everything?

16
00:00:43,129 --> 00:00:45,629
(Penny:)Hey, Leonard,
am I too late to see your experiment?

17
00:00:46,382 --> 00:00:48,382
(Bernadette:)-Oh, hi.
-Hi.

18
00:00:48,551 --> 00:00:51,341
(Bernadette:)-What are you doing here?
-Same thing you're doing here.

19
00:00:51,513 --> 00:00:54,513
(Howard:)-Came to see Leonard's experiment.
-No, you didn't.

20
00:00:54,682 --> 00:00:56,642
(Bernadette:)You said Leonard's experiment
was stupid.

21
00:00:57,977 --> 00:01:00,027
[HOWARD SIGHS]

